<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sappara</h1>
<p>Type of Weapon: Distanced Hand-to-hand.
</p><p>The sappara was an ancient Middle Eastern weapon forged most often of bronze attached to a wooden hilt. The sappara closely followed the khopesh in both form and function, although the sappara was edged only on the convex edge of the blade.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla there is no sappara skill of its own: such a weapon is fought with the skill of the kind of weapon it is. Look at it to see which (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
